      "slide": 1,
      "source": "owner-provided-script",
      "text": "Hi, I'm Jason Liu. One thing I built and shipped is a local AI platform that turns my Mac into a private developer assistant."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "profile_id": "en-male-25-default",
      "profile_revision": 1,
      "reference_sha256": "9a72457b9c4302d00664128f18141d289e00f935977b8e0acf31c6790ff56371",
      "script_sha256": "b21cc811efb23089c6920272346d5159c794749d71f4cb450d787d4e276cc522",
      "slide": 2,
      "source": "owner-provided-script",
      "text": "The problem was simple: cloud tools are powerful, but access, cost, and network conditions can change. I wanted a system that could keep helping me draft, test, summarize, and run structured workflows from my own machine."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "profile_id": "en-male-25-default",
      "profile_revision": 1,
      "reference_sha256": "9a72457b9c4302d00664128f18141d289e00f935977b8e0acf31c6790ff56371",
      "script_sha256": "b08b6ecefdc732f07ac1871777b62306242c7f5c1fab355237bc5f4048b1c240",
      "slide": 3,
      "source": "owner-provided-script",
      "text": "I installed and benchmarked a local Qwen model, exposed a local API, connected it to my project workflow, and used GitHub to track progress and changes."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "profile_id": "en-male-25-default",
      "profile_revision": 1,
      "reference_sha256": "9a72457b9c4302d00664128f18141d289e00f935977b8e0acf31c6790ff56371",
      "script_sha256": "3c7a8bb3988cc0ee60d09c85fc5af6d36913026ae493cacb515b0d32e1cd7296",
      "slide": 4,
      "source": "owner-provided-script",
      "text": "The useful part is the operating process around the model: reliable startup, tests, logging, fallbacks, and a repeatable way to turn ideas into working tools."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "profile_id": "en-male-25-default",
      "profile_revision": 1,
      "reference_sha256": "9a72457b9c4302d00664128f18141d289e00f935977b8e0acf31c6790ff56371",
      "script_sha256": "06d552285408cd4de10de37388b7675f8c1e1cf626c626e9b24f098cddf2b847",
      "slide": 5,
      "source": "owner-provided-script",
      "text": "This matters for Solana because builders need fast feedback. If selected, I would bring the same practical style to campus: less theory first, more demos, more shipping, and more students leaving each session with something that actually runs."
    }
  ],
  "target_language": null,
  "warning": null
}
